# Keep raw, unsanitized material OUT of the repo.
# Develop with real values locally; commit only sanitized files.

# Raw notes (may contain real IPs, hostnames, credentials)
*_raw.md
*_private.md
notes-private/
raw/

# Raw logs and exports (contain hostnames, IPs, SIDs)
*.log
*.json
*.json.gz
archives/
alerts/

# Credentials / secrets — never commit
*.key
*.pem
*.cert
secrets*
*password*
*credential*

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
